{
  "name": "Backlash",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> When you take damage, the module offers this Reaction if you have a 4th-level or higher slot: the damage is reduced by 4d6 + your spellcasting modifier, and if a creature within 60 ft dealt it, that creature makes a CON save, taking 4d6 Force damage on a failure or half on a success. Both increase by 1d6 per slot level above 4 (the lowest available slot is used).</p>",
